815 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 172 0 R
/T (Interpretation  The regression model indicated that neuroplasticity-enhancing practices explained 14.8% of the variance in academic performance. Extracurricular activities emerged as a significant direct predictor, while other practices showed weaker or non-significant direct effects. When cognitive engagement was introduced in subsequent models, the direct effects of several practices were reduced. )
/E (Interpretation  The regression model indicated that neuroplasticity-enhancing practices explained 14.8% of the variance in academic performance. Extracurricular activities emerged as a significant direct predictor, while other practices showed weaker or non-significant direct effects. When cognitive engagement was introduced in subsequent models, the direct effects of several practices were reduced. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [27 28]
>>
